    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「悪いね、転校生くん。君も大変だっただろうに、自転車で家まで送ってもらっちゃって」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「『駅伝大会』は自転車で始まり自転車に終わるね、お後がよろしいようで」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ごめんね、本気で僕はもう足が動きそうにないんだよ。走り終えたら、いっきに痛みが……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ううっ、涙がでちゃう！　女の子だもん！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ふたり乗りしてること、みんなには内緒だよ。とくに、生徒会のみんなにはね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「僕は、凛々しく頼もしい副会長で通ってるからね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ひまりに……もしかしたら、ともこにも怒られちゃうし」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「天下の副会長さまが公然と交通ルールを破ってしまったことは、知られたくないしね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ほんと、僕は悪い生徒会役員だよ……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「それに、相手がかわいい女の子だったら送り狼の楽しみがあったかもしれないけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「僕じゃねぇ、転校生くんも元気がでないでしょ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「あ～、でも良かった。ほっとしたよ、無事に勝ててさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「優勝したぞ～っ、はっはっは♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「みんなの喜びようったら、なかったね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「むつみなんか号泣しちゃってさ、お岩ちゃんも泣いてたかも……♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「高校生活最後の『駅伝大会』を、優勝で飾れてよかったよ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「実はさ、僕は君咲学院に入学したてのころ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「陸上部に入ったばかりで、みんなの足を引っ張ってしまってね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「僕のせいで、最初の『駅伝大会』は惨敗だった」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ずっと、心残りだったんだよ」"
