    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「ふふふ。湿っぽくなってしまったね、僕らしくもない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「このへんで降ろしてくれたまえ、転校生くん。君も疲れただろう、帰ってゆっくり休むといい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「おぉっと、ひとの話を聞いてるのかい。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「このへんで降ろしてくれたらいいってば、ほんとに僕んちまで送ってくれるつもり？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「家族に、ビックリされちゃうよ。男の子に送り届けてもらったりしたら……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「うちの家族、みんな僕のこと女の子だと思ってないんだもん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「『同性愛か！』とか言われちゃうよ、異性だってば！　やだやだ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「あぁもう……いっか、抵抗する気力がありません。好きにして～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 5,
    "dress": "old-w",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-w_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 8,
      "y": 510
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "みつる",
    "text": "「正直なところ、助かるしね。君の前では、強がる必要もないかな？」"
